N/A  ([https://supremevalues.com/mm2/ Supreme])}}'''Peppermint''' is a {{C|Common|common}} knife that is currently obtainable from the [[2025 Christmas Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2025]]. It was also one of the weapons used to craft the [[Coal (Effect)]]. 

== Appearance ==
Peppermint has a black handle and a blade decorated with red and white peppermint candy swirls. The blade also features red accents near the hilt, enhancing its holiday-themed aesthetic.

== Trivia ==

* It has a [[Peppermint Gun (2025)|matching gun]] under the same name.
